	measure '% HHI Pais Dinamico' = ```
			
			VAR __TabelaShare = 
			    ADDCOLUMNS(
			        VALUES(dim_countries[country_name]),
			        "@Share", [% Participacao no Total por Pais]
			    )
			RETURN
			    SUMX(__TabelaShare, [@Share] ^ 2)
			```
